{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"One day, two children visited a small shop in their neighborhood.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.3,0.7],[0.94,1.16],[1.24,1.73],[1.8,2.3],[2.37,2.42],[2.5,2.86],[2.93,3.2],[3.27,3.37],[3.42,3.62],[3.69,4.78]]},{"text":"They saw shiny coins in their pockets.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.52],[0.61,1.03],[1.13,1.56],[1.6,1.67],[1.73,1.92],[1.99,2.93]]},{"text":"Coins can look different. Some are bigger. Some are smaller.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.5,0.65],[0.72,0.93],[1,1.59],[1.73,1.99],[2.03,2.18],[2.24,2.72],[2.86,3.11],[3.16,3.31],[3.37,4.27]]},{"text":"They counted their coins carefully.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.35,0.77],[0.79,0.97],[1.06,1.46],[1.54,2.55]]},{"text":"One, two, three coins in all.","words":[[0,0.29],[0.31,0.61],[0.64,0.92],[0.99,1.35],[1.41,1.5],[1.59,2.18]]},{"text":"They wanted to buy one small toy.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.34,0.71],[0.76,0.82],[0.89,1.1],[1.21,1.45],[1.51,1.88],[1.96,2.79]]},{"text":"They gave the shopkeeper their coins.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.33,0.59],[0.64,0.71],[0.78,1.39],[1.47,1.67],[1.75,2.65]]},{"text":"The shopkeeper smiled and gave them the toy.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.26,0.93],[1.01,1.5],[1.56,1.67],[1.75,2],[2.04,2.19],[2.25,2.32],[2.39,3.16]]},{"text":"Money helps people trade things fairly.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.77],[0.84,1.18],[1.24,1.54],[1.59,1.87],[1.95,2.79]]},{"text":"They learned that counting money helps us know if we have enough.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.35,0.71],[0.73,0.91],[1,1.47],[1.56,1.83],[1.92,2.22],[2.28,2.42],[2.51,2.79],[2.87,2.98],[3.05,3.17],[3.25,3.48],[3.53,4.37]]}]}